DESCRIPTION="C1 — maximum ingestion: 16 producers without rate limit, consumers active, no readers. Measures producer throughput and how far each consumer falls behind at saturation. Labels: a, b, b-1rt (B with the single-round-trip producer, producer-1rt.sql)."
DURATION=300
